>wis affects praying success
>and secret-door-finding success.

This is false.

Successful prayers and successful searching affect wisdom (by exercising
it), but wisdom does not affect prayer or searching success.

The things that affect searching success are:
 * Wielding an artifact weapon that has the Searching attribute and
   non-zero enchantment
 * Wearing lenses while not blind
 * Luck

The things that affect prayer success are:
 * Luck
 * Alignment status
 * Prayer timeout
 * God anger
